Subject: [PATCH] Add filter system to /admin/lessons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add a server-rendered filter form (GET, no JS) above the lessons list,
  consistent with the existing filter pattern used on the Content
  Library page (FilterSelect + searchParams).
- Filters: search by title (q), status (Draft/Published), level
  (A1-C2), and topic — option lists are derived from the actual lesson
  data so they only ever show values that exist.
- Shows an 'X of Y lessons' count and a 'Clear filters' link when any
  filter is active.
- Filtering happens server-side against the already-fetched lessons
  array; works for both the mobile card list and the desktop table.
- Empty states now distinguish between 'No lessons yet' (no lessons in
  the DB) and 'No lessons match these filters' (filters too narrow).
---
